# Add this file as .npmrc in the root of any repository that consumes
# @lisandroalvo/gfg-design-system from GitHub Packages.
#
# 1. Copy this file to your project root and rename it to .npmrc
# 2. Set NODE_AUTH_TOKEN in your environment (shell profile, CI secret, etc.)
#    Use a GitHub token with at least `read:packages` scope.
#    Do NOT paste a real token into .npmrc — use the env-variable syntax below.
# 3. Run: npm install @lisandroalvo/gfg-design-system

@lisandroalvo:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
